Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Umamusume.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They are born to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They inherit the names of horses from another world,\Nwhose histories were sometimes tragic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and sometimes wonderful, and run ever forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is... their fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows how the races waiting\Nin the futures of these Umamusume will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But they will continue to run,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,aiming only toward the goal in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Avec Blaze is leading the pack,\Nbut the gap behind her is quickly closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The runners are making their way through the final turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:51.03,Default,,1,1,0,,Which of the Umamusume running today will win\Nthe Yayoi Sho and advance full speed onto the Classic Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone has entered the homestretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is moving up from the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega lingers behind the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.84,Alt,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live up... to everyone's expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road pushes from the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's favorite to win, Admire Vega,\Nhas begun to catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega is advancing quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose... for her sake as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega cuts through to second place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew she would end up right behind me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega has caught up, yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it enough to take the lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road crosses the finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road has won!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,An absolutely stunning victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was super amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.55,0:01:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran your heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Top Road!
