Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The arc is so large...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I told her to skip the morning session today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Still strugglin' with the small corners I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Trainer-san. Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you out here?\NPushing yourself the day after a race?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to relax, knowing that \NI'm finally moving on to the big races.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The big races, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The first race for a Classic Triple Crown title, the Satsuki Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem pretty fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of my promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To stand at the top of the Twinkle Series...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be a nobody,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's all thanks to an amazing\Ntrainer-san that I've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to repay that favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that you're going to be facing her again then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mornin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's chipper today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so surprising, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, it's Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. There's homework to collect today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please stack your notebooks over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Prez. Could you help me with some of this stuff later?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'd be happy to help if I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning... Here's my homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!{Did she say "Hai" (Yes.)...?} I'll add it to the pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a scrape right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I somehow didn't even realize it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you were pushing yourself so hard so early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting these things go untreated is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, so that must mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you also out doing\Nsome training this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you saw me fall and\Nfigured something might be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you training for the Satsuki Sho?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't plan to lose any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Above all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be outrunning the first place winner of the Yayoi Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad to hear you say that. Especially you, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:07:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the ideal that I constantly strive for, Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The ideal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always the favorite to win your races,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and your victory in your first graded race\Nwasn't even a matter of doubt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even close to your level yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing what I was up against during\Nthe Yayoi Sho inspired me to run like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be racing again.\NThis time, at the Satsuki Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.76,0:07:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I better get those notebooks over to the faculty room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for patching me up, Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to her. Not to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, look on at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look on at your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Umamusume enter the final turn.\NAfter winning the Yayoi Sho, the Classic Ro—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Repay the favor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that she's come so far as to be able to say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking the time to come watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's the least I can do for\Neverything you've done for me. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the spring in her step for someone her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Her footwork could use a bit of work, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets a bit of her pa's clumsiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Her character's pretty different from my own, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Her earnest nature never ceases to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:09:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Being able to devote oneself to this kind of training is a talent in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Sensei.{Teacher}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, goodbye now.\NBe careful on your way home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san, you're still runnin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just a little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my race coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Top Road sure is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck at the race!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be cheerin' you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear everyone's cheers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road crosses the finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road has won!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Training? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And with a pro trainer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Feeling shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that your running style is a bit rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your racing skills aren't fully up to snuff either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I can tell that you\Nhave what it takes to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I always get so nervous before a race...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I get so nervous and anxious...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be so,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but you always stand tall and go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't want to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're really tough for doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why everyone cheers you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...{That's why I'm cheering you on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Narita Top Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna aim for the top\Nof the Twinkle Series with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's come a long way since then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To stand at the top of the Twinkle Series, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's certainly become a realistic achievement for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.72,Top,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega advances from fourth to third place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:18.43,Top,,0,0,0,,She takes second place!\NAdmire Vega just misses out on the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have a certain someone here to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be at a disadvantage if she has to make any major accelerations in the final stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not great with small corners,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of worthy challengers to be wary of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:38.69,Top,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O has broken away! T.M. Opera O is in the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.69,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O extends her lead from three lengths to four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O clears the goal! A dazzling third consecutive win, and her first graded race victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible perseverance through such a crowded race agenda—what an achievement!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll likely be after a win at\Nthe Japanese Derby next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be an interesting race to watch after observing her performance here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:24.82,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985,855)\fad(200,0)}2 months ago
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A-Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just recover\Nfrom an injury? T-T-This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem I have matched\Nthe speed of light itself at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm sorry! I pushed the wrong button.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite all right, Doto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my victory at\Ntomorrow's maiden race is all but assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be victorious tomorrow, and \Nhe next time, and the next-next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I must boldly show everyone that I am up for the challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Up to what challenge, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Satsuki Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A Classic race without me would be akin to La Traviata without Violetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot let the audience down like that, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O! T.M. Opera O has won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A consecutive victory for T.M. Opera O!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Once more, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pushing yourself way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot abide the thought, Doto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Persevering through anguish is exactly\Nwhat the audience wishes to see in my performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can hear them, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The cries of anticipation for my appearance. The shouts praising my glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The curtains are rising, Doto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I will prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,On that stage that is the Satsuki Sho,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will prove that it is {\i1}I{\i0} who\Ndeserves to play the leading role!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The cafeteria at lunchtime is as bustling as a premiere at La Scala.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oguri-san, would you allow me\Nto partake next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You put on a great display at\Nthe Mainichi Hai the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I had the attention of\Nan Umamusume of such caliber as yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mainichi Hai is a race near\Nand dear to my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you decided on your next race?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Satsuki Sho, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It is for that very reason I overcame such an arduous rotation of races.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The toll it took on my body\Nwas not small, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But... even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think you should enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Receiving your approval is no small feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you'd offer some serious competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Oguri-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That inspires a tremendous\Namount of confidence within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going out so late tonight too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pushing yourself much more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to lose anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, I will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can make it up to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san's talent lies within the homestretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be right on my tail as she blazes onward during her last spurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was pretty much perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't count out her own gains in the next race, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go for it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep a cool head, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that time of the year once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the first race of the Classic Triple Crown series, the Satsuki Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Highly anticipated" would be an understatement this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:18:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and even though it's raining today, the excitement is palpable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All eyes are on this year's favorite and second-favorite, Admire Vega
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and Narita Top Road respectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty inconceivable that it will be anyone other than one of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome: Top Road-san, Ayabe-san!{}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To the grand performance of the first chapter in the Legend of the Centurial Overlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Triple Crowns are only fit for me, T.M. Opera O!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been truly amazing to see everything that you've accomplished, Opera O-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been giving everything I've got to my training,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and I won't be letting my trainer and\Neveryone else who has supported me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I... won't losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakayama Racecourse, turf, 2,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This year's Satsuki Sho features seventeen entrants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Satsuki Sho is the first race of the Classic Triple Crown series.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a once-in-a-lifetime challenge for these runners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Umamusume are making their way to the starting gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega has entered the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That calm demeanor is just one of the many reasons she is today's favorite to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is making\Nher way to the gate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We know ya can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.01,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road appears to be in top form,\Nand just listen to those cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is... a GI race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your cool. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.23,0:20:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of these runners will be taking home the first crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The race has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Every Umamusume is off to a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Petit Folklore push forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Will she, or won't she?\NTropical Sky comes in from the inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was a great start! In third place is Aqua Ocean, coming up rapidly to take the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,With Aqua Ocean in the lead,\Nthe runners are approaching the first turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our practice is payin' off in spades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's blocked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What can she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta break through...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not here. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Paces are average across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The pitch gradually increases as\Nthe runners approach the third turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tropical Sky takes the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The runners will start to prepare to make their last spurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega is moving up!\NNarita Top Road is in direct pursuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming out of the fourth turn are Admire Vega and Narita Top Road from the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They've entered the final stretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.77,Top,,0,0,0,,The shine of the Satsuki Sho crown is in their sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.35,0:21:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega loses speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose! Everyone's expectations...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san's dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Push through!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.35,0:22:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road bursts forth from the center! Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this! Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming in from the far outside is T.M. Opera O!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.77,0:22:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O is advancing fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some incredible acceleration!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O! T.M. Opera O has won the Satsuki Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-She did it! Opera O-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.01,0:23:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable... Opera O-san has come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to win this so badly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I had improved so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,An exceptional performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.25,0:23:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road was so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep cheering you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.16,Alt,,0,0,0,,Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.45,0:23:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to work even harder\Nto meet everyone's expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.10,0:23:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,what I can do at the Japanese Derby!

